Building Inspection Service refers to professional technical services provided by qualified institutions or engineering technicians, in accordance with laws, regulations, industry standards, and engineering technical specifications, to systematically inspect, evaluate, and issue reports on buildings during their design, construction, completion, or operation stages. The services range from structural safety reviews and system performance assessments to specialized sustainability audits, all of which are essential for compliance, risk mitigation, and value preservation.
